{
  "id": 1024,
  "name": "stretchy-spring",
  "fling_power": 30,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "loot",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/24/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ほそくて　ちいさい　バネ。\nすっかり　のびきって　つかいみちが\nみつからない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "가늘고 작은 용수철.\n완전히 늘어나서 어디에\n써야 할지 모르겠다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "細小的彈簧。\n已經完全鬆掉，\n找不到任何用途。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un petit ressort fin et complètement distendu.\nNul ne sait à quoi il peut bien servir.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine kleine, dünne Feder, die bis zum Äußersten\ngedehnt wurde. Man kann nicht mehr erkennen,\nwofür sie ursprünglich verwendet wurde.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Muelle fino y pequeño. Está algo elongado y se\ndesconoce cuál puede ser su uso.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una molla piccola e sottile.\nÈ deformata e ormai inutilizzabile.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A thin small spring. It’s totally stretched out, and\nwhat it’s used for is unknown.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "細くて　小さい　バネ。\nすっかり　伸びきって　使い道が\nみつからない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "细小的弹簧。\n被拉得太长了，\n不知道能派上什么用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
